{
  "about": "Every gem the Hanami application is installed with: hanami 3.0.2, hanami-action, hanami-router and hanami-view, dry-types, dry-operation, dry-validation, i18n and puma (the Gemfile of an application made by hanami new with no assets and no database), with what they require, resolved by scripts/lib/gem-resolve.rb at the newest versions at least seven days old. Each is installed by prepare.mjs at exactly this version after its age and checksum are checked; Gemfile.lock names the same versions (prepare.mjs refuses any other), so Bundler only loads what is installed. Gems that are part of Ruby itself (fromRuby) are not installed again.",
